ding or the website form may have broken — or they are drifting away.</div><div style="color:#475467;font-size:13px">How long: 14+ days quiet</div><div style="margin-top:4px"><strong>Do:</strong> <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px">Check their forwarding test and website form, then check in with the owner (churn risk).</span></div><div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:13px"><a href="https://dashboard.stripe.com/customers/cus_quiet" style="color:#175cd3">Stripe customer</a></div></li></ol><p style="color:#667085;font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #eaecf0;padding-top:10px;margin-top:20px">Sent daily after 07:30 America/Toronto only when something needs a human (plus a short all-clear on Mondays).<br>Preview any time: npm run job:operator-health -- --dry-run<br>Ops: https://app.empirevu.test/internal/ops</p></div>"`;

exports[`renderOperatorHealthEmail > golden: weekly all clear 1`] = `
"CrankLeads health — Mon, Oct 5, 2026

All clear — nothing needs you today.
Checked: setup progress (5-business-day guarantee), call forwarding, payments, provisioning, silent accounts, support requests, job queues.

Sent daily after 07:30 America/Toronto only when something needs a human (plus a short all-clear on Mondays).
Preview any time: npm run job:operator-health -- --dry-run
Ops: https://app.empirevu.test/internal/ops"
`;
